From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:18:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1422/3799] soh: rename func_80A44790 -> EnGo2_UpdateTalking

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: drives the conversation: the ordinary Gorons go through Npc_UpdateTalking, while Biggoron and the big rolling Goron use a hand-rolled offer that only engages once the player is touching their collider.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c
index 664413d3d..35019c0fb 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c
@@ -823,7 +823,8 @@ s16 EnGo2_UpdateTalkState(PlayState* play, Actor* thisx) {
     }
 }
 
-s32 func_80A44790(EnGo2* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A44790: drives the conversation: the ordinary Gorons go through Npc_UpdateTalking, while Biggoron and the big rolling Goron use a hand-rolled offer that only engages once the player is touching their collider.
+s32 EnGo2_UpdateTalking(EnGo2* this, PlayState* play) {
     if ((this->actor.params & 0x1F) != GORON_DMT_BIGGORON && (this->actor.params & 0x1F) != GORON_CITY_ROLLING_BIG) {
         return Npc_UpdateTalking(play, &this->actor, &this->interactInfo.talkState, this->interactRange,
                                  EnGo2_GetTextId, EnGo2_UpdateTalkState);
@@ -1104,7 +1105,7 @@ void func_80A45288(EnGo2* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
     if ((this->actionFunc != EnGo2_SetGetItem) &&
         GameInteractor_Should(VB_PREVENT_GORON_LINK_SOFTLOCK, this->isAwake, this)) {
-        if (func_80A44790(this, play)) {
+        if (EnGo2_UpdateTalking(this, play)) {  // was func_80A44790 [LLM:HIGH]
             EnGo2_BiggoronSetTextId(this, play, player);
         }
     }
